482:
(a) New homes constructed within an existing neighborhood shall comply with the standards in this chapter.
(b) Improvements to existing homes with a project cost greater than 50 percent of the home's value, will be subject to the standards for new construction.
(1) The home's value shall be based on the Glynn County appraised value;
